      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Mn(NO3)2·4H2O (0.1 g, 0.39 mmol), Gd(NO3)3·6H2O (0.1 g, 0.22 mmol), and C4 (0.1 g, 0.23 mmol) were dissolved in DMF (10 cm3) and MeOH (10 cm3). After 5 min stirring, NEt3 (0.2 g, 1.97 mmol) was added dropwise and the purple solution was stirred for a further hour. X-ray quality crystals were obtained after slow evaporation of the mother liquor.",
