        "summary": "Weakly exchanged isotropic [MnIII4GdIII4] cluster approaching S = 22 only at high field; large magnetocaloric effect making it an excellent low-temperature magnetic refrigerant. No SMM/slow-relaxation behavior is reported for 1.",
